    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "nia",
        "speaker": "Nia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 114,
        "text": "Hello, Cal. On class days, I wake at five. I get up and wash my face. My room is cool. What time do you wake?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9fcc05cdb86109a5337b09f56ec57563617d5799c50396c82a1ef6a483d594eb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "cal",
        "speaker": "Cal",
        "sourceStart": 121,
        "sourceEnd": 231,
        "text": "I wake at six. I put on a shirt. I put a sock on each foot. My shoe is under the bed. I find it and put it on.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "22c39730c7b1c5009d4f5b2eb78de164ccf5ff862c5d615f7d882348cdae6926",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nia",
        "speaker": "Nia",
        "sourceStart": 238,
        "sourceEnd": 367,
        "text": "I have a blue shirt today. I also have a dress, but I choose the shirt. The sun is out, so I put a hat on my head before I leave.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "45e07309e61594c84f84a55ffe568e0a546802d6b712e52e61a3505931ab0b40",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "cal",
        "speaker": "Cal",
        "sourceStart": 374,
        "sourceEnd": 488,
        "text": "I take a quick look at my note. I start class at ten. Do you start at ten too? We can meet our group at the table.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ce711cf0fc7367509837e5147345efa5cf7514b39357b5739aa04234880c11da",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nia",
        "speaker": "Nia",
        "sourceStart": 495,
        "sourceEnd": 643,
        "text": "Yes. I start at ten. I eat lunch at one and finish class at three. After class, I stay in the room for five minutes. I check a note for the teacher.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "d1f6bec38200aea9a1dbc8f8382649bd7b792c53bd1668705dfd84e3449acbf5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "cal",
        "speaker": "Cal",
        "sourceStart": 650,
        "sourceEnd": 795,
        "text": "I finish at three too. Then I leave with you. I take a slow walk to the shop. A short walk helps my body feel ready for the next part of the day.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "1bc8976ce43c374345404e193e058f8a4296a56f43aa38191fe3a17cb9a7768c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nia",
        "speaker": "Nia",
        "sourceStart": 802,
        "sourceEnd": 943,
        "text": "I lift my hand to wave to a friend. I eat dinner at six. Before dinner, I write my class time for tomorrow. I plan to wear my dress tomorrow.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c7bad71b0a0cec4f4629633293f1ce0e592917645a7cfac25636dd50fa8925f9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "cal",
        "speaker": "Cal",
        "sourceStart": 950,
        "sourceEnd": 1071,
        "text": "That is a good plan. I check my hair before dinner. I do not need the same plan as you. We can each choose our own times.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2580c1a84d59c3822cdeda7efa817c73f5d962cef561f87e1ca339425eb7c06a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
